bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28, 0, "CSS 2.2 appendix E paints in-flow block backgrounds (step 4) before floats (step 5). Simple paints in tree order, so a block that follows a float in the source and overlaps it covers the float. Chrome 159, block top CSS y 50: float rows 200..279 at k=4 (50..69 at k=1); Simple 240..279 (60..69)."
    web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28, 1, "Same class: a 10.75px right float beside a clear:left block that starts at 10.25px loses its last rows (Chrome 1600..1642 at k=4, Simple 1600..1640); that row is left unpinned in float_fractional_height_clear_chrome159_spec."

bugs_active |id, severity, status, title, file, line, reproducible_by, created_at, updated_at, valid|
    web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28, P2, fix-implemented-verification-pending, "web render: a float is painted under a later in-flow block's background", src/lib/gc_async_mut/gpu/browser_engine/simple_web_html_layout_renderer_paint_layout.spl, 1105, test/01_unit/browser_engine/float_paint_order_chrome159_spec.spl, 2026-11-28, 2026-11-28, true

bug_investigation_logs |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28, 0, "2026-11-28 frac-float-svg lane: measured, not fixed (paint order, outside the layout lane). Suggested fix: emit float box commands and their descendants after the in-flow block backgrounds of the same stacking context, before inline content."
    web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28, 1, "2026-11-28: ba32f7509eb gave _html_draw_ir_node_paint_order CSS 2.2 Appendix E scopes (blocks, floats, inlines; float and opacity sub-scopes), which fixed the reported case. The float-paint-order lane added, in the same scope design: an atomic inline (inline-*) and a flex or grid item are sub-scopes painted whole in Step 7; a block-level opacity/backdrop group paints as a layer after the inline content. Chrome 159 measured at k=1 and k=4 for twelve cases (float_paint_order_chrome159_spec)."
    web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28, 2, "Not changed: a block inside an inline box paints in Step 4; a transformed box is not a layer; a non-positioned layer and a z-auto positioned box are not interleaved in tree order; flex/grid `order` does not reorder painting; hit-testing without generated content still breaks ties by arena order; a block-level form control is a unit listed with the inline content (engine2d_plain_text_inherits_selected_face_2026-11-28), so a display:block control overlapped by a float now paints over the float (deliberate trade); z-index on a static flex or grid item is not honoured; an opacity box inside a float or unit stays in that unit; an inline-level opacity group paints at Step 7; a negative z-index is parsed as positive (web_render_negative_z_index_parsed_positive_2026-11-28), so the absolute/fixed exclusion from flex/grid items is unreachable."
    web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28, 3, "close_evidence reproducer=test/01_unit/browser_engine/float_paint_order_chrome159_spec.spl prevention=test/01_unit/browser_engine/float_paint_order_chrome159_spec.spl"
    web_render_float_painted_under_later_block_background_2026-11-28, 4, "2026-11-28 verification (seed wr-seed1126b, base 0829e113e88 after rebase): float_paint_order_chrome159_spec base 7/13 (AC-4,5,8,10, AC-11 grid, AC-12 flex red) -> lane 13/13; AC-13 (a display:block button keeps its block child on top, Chrome 159 k=1/k=4) was red on the pre-fix lane; direction_rtl_bidi_order base 3/7 -> lane 7/7; mandatory specs equal base (121/123, 131/131, 68/68, 22/22); combo matrix 130 with the same mismatching ids as base (release regression, not this lane); 1x and 4x catalog mismatch_pct equal base on all 8 pages. Earlier, on base 2cc01cddc4d, a 310-spec sweep plus a 79-spec form-control re-sweep found no spec worse than base. float_fractional_height_clear (0/10) and float_paint_stacking_order (1/3) fail identically on lane and base on semantic errors (fractional: Style has no field contain_layout, simple_web_html_layout_renderer_layout_engine.spl:5908; stacking: DrawIrComposition has no field commands, spec line 36), so their REQ-WEB-001 pins (including stacking AC-3) are unmeasured on this seed. Perf, interpreter dispatch totals vs base on 2cc01cddc4d: css-layout k=1 +0.015%, k=4 +0.003%; html k=1 +0.051%, k=4 +0.004%. Draw IR render of 200 / 800 inline-blocks (3 alternating rounds): +15.8k / +62.6k dispatches (about 79 per unit, linear), wall within 1%, RSS equal. Pending: verification after landing."
